# Machine-generated translation (LLM), not yet reviewed by a native speaker.
#: sparkth/plugins/compose/constants.py:96
msgid ""
"I'm a course creation assistant and can only help with designing and "
"building courses. Tell me about the course you're working on and I can "
"help you plan it, write it or improve it."
msgstr ""
"Soy un asistente de creación de cursos y solo puedo ayudarte a diseñar y "
"crear cursos. Cuéntame sobre el curso en el que estás trabajando y podré "
"ayudarte a planificarlo, redactarlo o mejorarlo."

# Machine-generated translation (LLM), not yet reviewed by a native speaker.
#: sparkth/plugins/compose/constants.py:101
msgid ""
"I've done as much as I can in one go. Send another message and I'll carry"
" on from here."
msgstr ""
"Hice todo lo que podía por ahora. Envía otro mensaje y continuaré desde "
"aquí."

#: sparkth/plugins/compose/plugin.py:53 sparkth/plugins/compose/plugin.py:58
msgid "Compose"
msgstr "Componer"

#: sparkth/plugins/compose/plugin.py:54
